    "number": 86493,
    "subject": "Switch to bootstrap-vue-next (Overview page) Changes added: - Upgraded Bootstrap from version 4.6.2 to 5.3.6 and switched to bootstrap-vue-next. - Updated Vue and related packages to version 3.5.13. - Replaced Vue's event bus with mitt for better performance and simplicity. - Refactored components to use the new event bus implementation. - Cleaned up unused imports and styles related to bootstrap-vue. Problem: The old bootstrap-vue is not supported. Solution: Upgraded Bootstrap to 5.3.6 and switch to bootstrap-vue-next. Testing: - Verified that overview components correctly respond to events using the new event bus. - Ensured that the application layout and navigation function as expected with the updated dependencies. Action Item: - Replace mitt-based global EventBus with Pinia store events when migrating from Vuex. Signed-off-by: Shane Lin <hslin@nvidia.com>",
